msgid "Preserve MainWP Connection"
msgstr "MainWP-verbinding behouden"

msgid "Preserves MainWP Child connection details from being overwritten during WP Migrate (formerly WP Migrate DB Pro) push/pull operations and database imports."
msgstr "Behoudt de verbindingsgegevens van MainWP Child tegen overschrijven tijdens push/pull-operaties en database-importen van WP Migrate (voorheen WP Migrate DB Pro)."

